{
  "_comment": [
    "The MCU no-heap link check's ratchet (tools/check_no_heap.py, #1783, ADR-0083 Decision 1).",
    "Per target, every call site that still references the heap: {object: {section: {entry point:",
    "count}}}, the section being the function with -ffunction-sections. A pin may only be lowered",
    "(--repin); a site not pinned here, or one whose count grew, fails CI. Empty targets are the",
    "goal. Most pins are deleting destructors (a virtual destructor references operator delete from",
    "every object that emits the vtable) and std containers not yet on the seam; the PR for #1783",
    "lists them by cause."
  ],
